  "term": "bundling",
  "definition": "Bundling here means combining multiple FDA expedited program features for a therapy into one overall measure of regulatory pathway intensity. In this study, it referred to summarizing the mix of designations and review pathways a product received as a single Regulatory Bundling Index.",
